Welcome to Pong Kombat 3! (v0.9)

The program is still under development (of course) but we have enough for you
to play with and enjoy... as long as you don't mind the occasional crash.

Instructions:
  Some machine must be running "pkd", found in the bin directory.  We hope to
  find a dedicated machine to run pkd on once it becomes a bit more stable.

  Once pkd is running, each person wishing to play must run what is currently
  called "pkclient, found again in bin.  This will soon be renamed pk3.

  One player must start a game, then the other players must click on the game
  in the game list and select join.

  When setting up the game, there's a bug in the GUI so you won't be able to
  accurately tell what team your opponent has chosen.  Decide this before you
  start :)

  You'll probably want to know the keys too...  use the arrow keys to move
  around the screen and a, s, d are punch, kick, and block.  And no, I won't
  tell you the special moves :P

  Helpful Note: You'll most likely want to do a "xset r" after running pkclient
  since it doesn't exit exactly as we'd like it to so it doesn't turn key repeat
  back on for you.

Bug Reporting:
  Don't bother.  We already know about a great many bugs, and once we've fixed
  all of them that we know about, we'll start asking for bug reports.

